469
00:36:32,708 --> 00:36:33,625
¿Cierto, Benji?

470
00:36:34,416 --> 00:36:36,583
Me alegra mucho… que…

471
00:36:38,041 --> 00:36:39,333
pidiera el…

472
00:36:42,333 --> 00:36:43,583
Es el…

473
00:36:44,666 --> 00:36:45,750
La cosa.

474
00:36:46,375 --> 00:36:47,958
